    { n: "Tally-Law", t: "Aldrec has advantage on Insight and Persuasion checks in any negotiation where terms, debts, or oaths are at issue. He counts silently in Skell when angry." },
    { n: "Tide-Roar (Recharge 5\u20136)", t: "A war-shout in a 30-foot cone: each creature must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or be deafened and pushed 10 feet (ships\u2019 crews have lost boarding actions to the voice alone)." }
